     collecting entirely.                                       
                                                                
  A good rule of thumb is [38;5;153mleave-no-trace[39m. Whatever you carry in,
  carry out, and whatever lives there stays there.              
                                                                
  [2m▎[0m [3m"Take only pictures, leave only footprints."[0m                
                                                                
  Follow that motto and the pools will stay healthy for the next
  curious visitor, and for the animals that call them home.     

